{
  "name": "Connector: Gmail (alerts)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Connector: Gmail (alerts and digest)\n\nEmails each alert to the owning rep (cc'ing the champion's AE when someone else owns the new account) and emails the digest.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Add a Gmail credential to both Gmail nodes.\n2. In **Config**, set `digest_recipients` and a `fallback_recipient` for alerts with no owner email (add rep emails in the core team directory).\n3. Copy this workflow's ID into the core Config as `alert_connector_id`.\n\n**Actions:** alert, digest.\n\nContract: docs/connectors.md in the repo.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "af30550d-d2f5-4a71-a6ed-d2307476bab9",
      "name": "Note: Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "8c0e5fb2-805f-43af-af30-2553ee5a2b44",
      "name": "When Called by Core",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "12b7707b-64c1-412f-ace4-c559e7c2dbf4",
              "name": "digest_recipients",
              "value": "gtm-team@yourcompany.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d6e5ea3d-4bcf-4093-adf8-e5869ea29a27",
              "name": "fallback_recipient",
              "value": "gtm-team@yourcompany.com",
              "type": "string"
